{"schema_version":"1.7.5","id":"ALSA-2026:46395","published":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-07-28T15:29:52.525021831Z","related":["CVE-2026-27145","CVE-2026-39821"],"summary":"Important: go-fdo-server security update","details":"This package provides a server-side implementation of the FIDO Device Onboard (FDO) specification, written in Go. FDO is an open standard for the late binding of device credentials, allowing for automated and secure on-boarding of devices when they are first powered on in their final location.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * golang.org/x/net/idna: golang: golang.org/x/net/idna: Privilege escalation via incorrect Punycode label processing (CVE-2026-39821)\n  * crypto/x509: golang: golang crypto/x509: Denial of Service via excessive processing of DNS SAN entries (CVE-2026-27145)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"go-fdo-server","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/go-fdo-server"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.0.1-2.el10_2.3"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux10/ALSA-2026:46395.json"}},{"package":{"name":"go-fdo-server-manufacturer","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/go-fdo-server-manufacturer"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.0.1-2.el10_2.3"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux10/ALSA-2026:46395.json"}},{"package":{"name":"go-fdo-server-owner","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/go-fdo-server-owner"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.0.1-2.el10_2.3"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux10/ALSA-2026:46395.json"}},{"package":{"name":"go-fdo-server-rendezvous","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:10","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/go-fdo-server-rendezvous"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.0.1-2.el10_2.3"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux10/ALSA-2026:46395.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:46395"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-27145"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-39821"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/2480756"},{"type":"REPORT","url":"https://bugzilla.redhat.com/2484207"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://errata.almalinux.org/10/ALSA-2026-46395.html"}]}